    "year": 2022,
    "description": "Computation is one of the most powerful tools for our age. It opens up a whole world of possibilities. Some people use its power to solve the mysteries of our universe through science. I’m using it to explore our relationship with beauty and perception.\n\n“Miragem” *(Mirage in Portuguese)* is a generative project that requires your slow attention. It’s an exploration of rhythm, balance, and texture. Just simple elements in a coordinated dance, ruled by math and randomness.\n\n**It’s an invitation for the eyes and mind to wander.**\n\n\n >>  ‎  \n>> ## “Beauty is the mystery of life. It is not in the eye, it is in my mind. In our minds there is awareness of perfection.”\n>> Agnes Martin\n\n ‎\n*Please check the project website to know more about the composition and features.*",
